+
+# DOT_EDGE_ATTR is concatenated with DOT_COMMON_ATTR. For elegant style you can
+# add 'arrowhead=open, arrowtail=open, arrowsize=0.5'. <a
+# href=https://graphviz.org/doc/info/arrows.html>Complete documentation about
+# arrows shapes.</a>
