@@ -0,0 +1,167 @@
+/*
+ * Renesas SCP/MCP Software
+ * Copyright (c) 2020-2021, Renesas Electronics Corporation. All rights
+ * reserved.
+ *
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
